      "categoryID": 1,
      "benefits": "Preclinical tissue-repair research: BPC-157 improved wound-healing measures, including collagen formation and tensile strength, in rat skin-incision and intestinal-anastomosis experiments. These animal findings identify a research interest in healing and recovery; they do not establish reliable injury-recovery benefits in people."
    }
